  "design": {
    "decision": "Count [♠] winners into the bid and stretch the contract, since each [♠] win is worth more the higher your team bids.",
    "opponent": "Shown on the first [♠] win; opponents try to set high contracts by leading [♠] to pull trumps together.",
    "rationale": "It meets the bid-tension target at rare and replaces the weak flat seed-spade-mult shape with one that scales with the contract (cb-contract-mult is the strongest measured common shape). The ♠-win filter keeps it a Spades piece, not a generic one.",
